! RT01 初期構成 (uRPF TS・昨日 anti-spoofing を導入した直後の状態)
interface Loopback0
 ip address 24.24.24.24 255.255.255.255
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description === Uplink-A: to ISP (RT02) ===
 ip address 10.181.106.1 255.255.255.252
 ip verify unicast source reachable-via rx
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description === Uplink-B: to ISP (RT03) ===
 ip address 10.136.242.1 255.255.255.252
 ip verify unicast source reachable-via rx
 no shutdown
!
router ospf 1
 router-id 24.24.24.24
 network 24.24.24.24 0.0.0.0 area 0
 network 10.181.106.0 0.0.0.3 area 0
 network 10.136.242.0 0.0.0.3 area 0
!
